#!/bin/sh
# Volume and brightness keys with a dunst popup (bar via the int:value hint).
# Usage: homestead-osd volume up|down|mute | brightness up|down | kbd up|down
# No backlight device: does nothing. No notification daemon: the level still changes.

notify() { # tag icon summary body [percent]
    notify-send -u low -t 1500 -i "$2" -h "string:x-dunst-stack-tag:homestead-$1" \
        ${5:+-h "int:value:$5"} "$3" "$4" >/dev/null 2>&1
}

case $1 in
volume)
    case $2 in
    up) out=$(amixer set Master 5%+ unmute) ;;
    down) out=$(amixer set Master 5%- unmute) ;;
    mute) out=$(amixer set Master toggle) ;;
    *) exit 2 ;;
    esac || exit 1
    paplay /usr/share/homestead/sounds/audio-volume-change.oga >/dev/null 2>&1 &
    # amixer prints e.g. "Front Left: Playback 36043 [55%] [on]"
    pct=$(printf '%s\n' "$out" | sed -n 's/.*\[\([0-9]*\)%\].*/\1/p' | head -n1)
    if printf '%s\n' "$out" | grep -q '\[off\]'; then
        notify volume audio-volume-muted Volume Muted
    else
        if [ "${pct:-0}" -eq 0 ]; then icon=muted
        elif [ "$pct" -lt 34 ]; then icon=low
        elif [ "$pct" -lt 67 ]; then icon=medium
        else icon=high; fi
        notify volume "audio-volume-$icon" Volume "$pct%" "$pct"
    fi
    ;;
brightness | kbd)
    tag=$1
    if [ "$1" = brightness ]; then
        set -- "$2" -c backlight --min-value=1%
        step=5% icon=display-brightness title=Brightness
    else
        set -- "$2" -d '*kbd_backlight' --min-value=0
        # brightnessctl -m: device,class,current,percent,max
        info=$(brightnessctl -m "$2" "$3" info 2>/dev/null) || exit 0
        step=$(( ${info##*,} / 16 )); [ "$step" -gt 0 ] || step=1
        icon=keyboard-brightness title=Keyboard
    fi
    case $1 in
    up) sign=+ ;;
    down) sign=- ;;
    *) exit 2 ;;
    esac
    shift
    out=$(brightnessctl -m "$@" set "$step$sign" 2>/dev/null) || exit 0
    pct=$(printf '%s\n' "$out" | cut -d, -f4 | tr -d %)
    notify "$tag" "$icon" "$title" "$pct%" "$pct"
    ;;
*)
    echo "usage: ${0##*/} volume up|down|mute | brightness up|down | kbd up|down" >&2
    exit 2
    ;;
esac
exit 0
